## What this skill helps you do

{{DESCRIPTION}}

This package is built automatically from one source skill. Its instructions and references
are installed together for Codex; unrelated upstream skills are excluded.

## Quick start

Requires Python 3.11 or later. Clone the package, then run from its root:

~~~text
python -m pip install -r skills/{{SLUG}}/requirements.txt
python skills/{{SLUG}}/scripts/install.py --project PATH_TO_EXISTING_PROJECT
~~~

Open that project in Codex and invoke:

~~~text
${{SLUG}} {{REQUEST}}
~~~

The installer copies the whole skill to the project's .agents/skills/{{SLUG}} directory
and refuses to replace an existing installation.

