## Verification

~~~text
python -B -m unittest discover -s skills/{{SLUG}}/tests -v
~~~

Tests cover a complete fresh install, preservation of an existing installation,
refusal of a missing project and the {{SLUG}} runtime case described above.
CI exercises Windows and Ubuntu with Python 3.11 and 3.13.

## Scope

This is a deterministic Python conversion using the {{SLUG}} runtime adapter.
No LLM is used to convert or test this package. The tests establish package installation
and the bounded runtime case; they do not establish Codex reasoning quality, every upstream
example, performance gains or suitability for a particular production dataset.
No cloud, GPU or external service integration is tested.
Review retained instructions and adapt examples to your own inputs.

